WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.236
Buying Bitcoin got easy. Choosing a sound plan did not.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:12.630
Verdict starts with your plan, in your own words. One sentence is enough: how much, how often, and where you keep it.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.196
It reads what you wrote, and confirms what kind of decision it is.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.177
Every plan is scored on the same ten signals, so you can see where yours really stands.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:31.856
Then a few quick answers fill in what an AI would otherwise have to guess: your country, the amount, when you might need the money, and your reserve.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.046
It asks the uncomfortable questions too. Bitcoin falls seventy percent. What do you actually do?

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.236
One last look at how Verdict understood you. Then it rates your plan.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:56.935
You get a score from zero to a hundred, the weakest point, and three next steps. It rates how complete your thinking is, not whether to buy.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.211
Every gap tells you what to write. Add it to your plan, right where it's missing.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:11.127
Rate it again, and see exactly what changed. Forty becomes fifty, and the next weakest point comes into focus.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:19.197
When you're ready, see partners that match your criteria, with their MiCA licence checked. You compare, and you choose.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:28.969
Want the full picture? Join the waitlist for the full report: all ten areas, a step plan, and a PDF to keep. Fourteen euros, once.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:36.936
Verdict. Check your Bitcoin plan before your money does. Free, with no account, at virtuse dot com.
